  "description": "Marriage is not on her agenda! When a two-time mixed martial arts champion dies and wakes up in the body of the petite Lady Grace Rambler, she quickly decides to make the best of things -- to attract a so-called “unicorn man,” the rare kind of gentleman who’s modest, exciting, and handsome! But her dreams are crushed when she finds out Grace is set to marry Duke Aston Blade, a perverted and ugly old geezer… Or is he?! Not willing to risk it, she rejects the marriage and sticks to her guns. It’s either a unicorn man or bust! \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
